Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.61,0:00:09.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning... Wha— Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are you naked?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.35,0:00:13.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because it's Sunday.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That doesn't explain anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.35,0:00:20.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before we eat breakfast,\Nhow about... you—eat—me?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meddling again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.19,0:00:27.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We would have no need to meddle\Nif you simply behaved yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.55,0:00:29.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, lighten up, Cecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep a close eye on them, May.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember, we didn't come to\Nthis world for the fun of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M'kay!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.17,0:00:39.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those clothes... You're going to work?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.18,0:00:42.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I got called in today.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.09,0:00:43.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.79,0:00:48.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil sure is busy...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.05,0:00:53.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was tasked with monitoring\NMariabell for one month...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.99,0:00:59.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And somehow, I ended up at a hot spring.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.75,0:02:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, this is what they mean by "luxurious"...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.25,0:02:05.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.29,0:02:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May! Can't you be quieter?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.29,0:02:11.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, but we get this place\Nall to ourselves today.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, be that as it may...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.32,0:02:17.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we had a choice with the reservation,\Nthen we should've booked co-ed.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Come over to our side!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.22,0:02:20.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-That's against the rules!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.11,0:02:23.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit bothering Lord Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.29,0:02:27.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Cecil, don't be such a grump.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.23,0:02:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give me some space, May!\NYou're pushing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.75,0:02:32.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be thanking me right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.51,0:02:35.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was the one who got us\Ninto this place, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.97,0:02:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With over 100,000 subscribers,\Nwelcome to MayMay's Parallel Universe!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.42,0:02:44.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We get to stay at this swanky\Nhot spring resort
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.09,0:02:46.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'cause of my streaming sponsorship!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.59,0:02:49.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm grateful for that, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi—na—ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.02,0:02:53.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see you!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.02,0:02:53.99,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you hiding?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me see everything!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.64,0:03:00.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you won't come over here,\Nthen I'll just have to—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.43,0:03:00.19,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.72,0:03:01.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.19,0:03:04.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.31,0:03:07.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've had\Na long soak in the tub...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.41,0:03:10.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're always using the shower at the house.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.60,0:03:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is going to take all night...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.80,0:03:21.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's back and forth between work and home...\Nwith no break in between...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.05,0:03:24.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In a way, it's even more exhausting\Nthan fighting demons.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.79,0:03:29.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmph. If it sucks so much,\Nyou should just go back to our world.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.77,0:03:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.88,0:03:34.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Calm down. You're just cranky\Nbecause you're hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.34,0:03:37.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go have some dinner and relax!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.05,0:03:42.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've only ever seen a spread\Nlike this on TV!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.69,0:03:45.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it really on the house?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.01,0:03:47.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This seems extravagant for\Nan online streamer...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.48,0:03:51.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not just going to eat it.\NI have to review it, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.41,0:03:52.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That reminds me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You guys should help me with my stream!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll put a filter over your faces.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, you can be the cameraman!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's streaming right now?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.95,0:04:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo! It's MayMay's Parallel Universe!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May the demi-human here,\Nready to make my viewers smile!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.92,0:04:17.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have some first-time guests\Nwith me today!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Hello...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.51,0:04:20.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi there...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.69,0:04:23.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She looks... a lot like Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This hotel has an incredible\Nhot spring and food,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.95,0:04:29.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the specialty around these parts is...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.90,0:04:31.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.91,0:04:33.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is that stuff?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.41,0:04:34.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's oden!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.98,0:04:35.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.97,0:04:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since we've got all this good food,\Nwhy don't we have an eating contest?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw a comedian on TV\Ndo it the other day!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.92,0:04:44.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. It isn't polite to play with your food.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's insulting to the people\Nwho made it for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Always so serious...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.13,0:04:51.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I guess we'll just eat it like normal!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.56,0:04:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have this one!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Smells yummy!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.71,0:05:01.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the bonito stock gives it\Nso much flavor!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.55,0:05:04.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that broth really hits the spot!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have some, you guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.39,0:05:07.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.39,0:05:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I think I'll try the sausage.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here ya go!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.00,0:05:13.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Er, I can do it—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.02,0:05:14.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine! Open wide!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hot—!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.29,0:05:19.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, put it in your mouth!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.40,0:05:20.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.37,0:05:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all over your face!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it's sticky...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.83,0:05:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should I lick it clean for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.58,0:05:28.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.66,0:05:30.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Help...!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.25,0:05:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was kinda lewd...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.67,0:05:37.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for accidentally\Nending the stream...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No worries!\NI let everyone know what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.82,0:05:43.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The important part is that we had fun.\NIt's all good!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.85,0:05:45.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.05,0:05:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sweaty.\NShould we hop in the bath again?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.00,0:05:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had a blast on stream!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, May?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.52,0:06:03.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What made you decide to\Nbecome a streamer?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.91,0:06:07.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make people smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.41,0:06:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place is peaceful 'cause\Nthere aren't any demons...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but lots of the people here\Nare burnt-out and struggling.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.93,0:06:16.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make people happy
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.59,0:06:18.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,like when we defeated\Nthe Demon Lord back home.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.34,0:06:20.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's when...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was introduced to streaming.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like being surrounded by smiling faces,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.68,0:06:31.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I want to make as many\Npeople smile as I can!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.24,0:06:35.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You found a great job,\None you can be passionate about.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.15,0:06:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But my job is a lot of fun, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.25,0:06:41.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really? It seems hard...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's tough but rewarding.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.11,0:06:46.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Watching you and Mariabell\Nfrolicking about in this world...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.78,0:06:50.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I forgot about my mission and\Nimmersed myself in my work.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.70,0:06:56.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I, too, began enjoying it here\Nwithout even realizing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.96,0:06:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This world is tons of fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.25,0:07:03.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I feel like Hinata smiles more here, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.15,0:07:07.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's because he's no longer\Nburdened by heroic duty.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.35,0:07:11.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata seems more pleasant\Nthan before, more human.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.66,0:07:18.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which... where is Lord Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.05,0:07:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He said he was gonna\Ntake a bath in his room...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mariabell is missing, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.62,0:07:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata is in danger!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.16,0:07:30.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They even have huge, fancy tubs\Nin the rooms...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.49,0:07:31.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This hotel is nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, just the two of us at last!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.09,0:07:35.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought you went to the open-air bath with—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.34,0:07:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in being\Nsomewhere you're not.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.71,0:07:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That includes the bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.63,0:07:43.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be in here together—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.19,0:07:49.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw... But if I get out now,\NI might catch a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.72,0:07:52.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I wanted to talk to you alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.89,0:07:56.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is my very first vacation in this world...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.26,0:07:59.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.25,0:08:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the whole point of this trip\Nis to cheer up Miss Cecil, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.17,0:08:11.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. It's just me here, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.41,0:08:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to act tough.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.13,0:08:16.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is, you were worried about\NMiss Cecil, weren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.59,0:08:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I was not!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just... In the other world,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.84,0:08:25.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the only humans who didn't look down\Non dark elves were you...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.18,0:08:33.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If she isn't feeling well,\Nit'll throw me out of whack, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not very honest.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want me to be honest?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.11,0:08:40.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There is something that's\Nbeen bothering me...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Earlier... you saw Cecil's boobs, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Th-That whole thing\Nwas just an accident...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you did see them.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.05,0:08:55.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only boobs you're allowed to\Nlook at in this world are mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.28,0:08:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only man who's allowed to\Nlook at my boobs is you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know you're special to me, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.23,0:09:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you said another pair of boobs\Nwere better than mine,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.50,0:09:09.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would probably massacre\Nevery woman on this planet.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.93,0:09:12.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to be addicted to my boobs,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.85,0:09:15.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so much so that you're\Nindifferent to all other boobs.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, she's intense...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.41,0:09:21.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hinata? I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.30,0:09:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then should we stop by the store?\NIf we go now, we might—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to devour you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.32,0:09:30.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling any better?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.38,0:09:35.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, Bell, this trip was for—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.12,0:09:37.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's fine now.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.16,0:09:40.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So isn't it your turn to relax\Nand let yourself go?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.09,0:09:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you keep doing that, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.50,0:09:46.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Cecil!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.81,0:09:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meddling again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.50,0:09:51.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was only coaxing mini-Hinata\Nout of his shell!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were cheering Hinata up?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.60,0:09:56.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's all lift his spirits!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.44,0:09:57.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shield your eyes!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we can all take a bath together!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.56,0:10:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cannonball!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.12,0:10:15.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My first vacation with Hinata in this world\Nand we still didn't do it...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, now. It was a nice hotel.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.42,0:10:21.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! And we had a total blast!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you feel more rested?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.23,0:10:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.04,0:10:27.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to cut down on\Nmy workload a little from now on.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.89,0:10:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Good to hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.25,0:10:33.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too bad you didn't make yourself sick\Nand have to go back home!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.82,0:10:38.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll leave as soon as I'm certain\Nyou aren't going to cause any problems.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.07,0:10:42.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Officially, I've been tasked with\Nmonitoring the two of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.44,0:10:49.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On a personal level, I'm rooting for you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.12,0:10:52.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.36,0:10:58.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd throw me out of whack!
